#: ../../examples/approval.rst:2
msgid "Pause for external approval"
msgstr "暂停以等待外部审批"

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:4
msgid "Correlate an external reply with a waiting tool. The simulated UI answers immediately; duplicate replies are rejected. No export is actually performed."
msgstr "把外部回复与正在等待的工具关联起来。模拟的 UI 会立即作答；重复的回复会被拒绝。实际上不会执行任何导出。"

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:7
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "运行示例"

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:9
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录下："

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:15
msgid "The output includes:"
msgstr "输出包含："

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:21
msgid "This program uses deterministic offline models and temporary storage where needed. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序使用确定性的离线模型，并在需要时使用临时存储。它不需要 API 密钥，由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:25
msgid "Connect an approval UI"
msgstr "接入审批 UI"

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:27
msgid "The example publishes an approval request, pauses the tool, and sends a correlated reply back through the client. In a real application, replace the simulated reply with your UI's accept or reject action."
msgstr "示例会发布一个审批请求，暂停该工具，并通过客户端发回一个关联的回复。在真实的应用中，请把模拟的回复替换成你 UI 的接受或拒绝操作。"

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:35
msgid "Keep the session, request, and tool-call identifiers with the prompt you show the user. A reply for another request must not authorize this one. The example checks that a duplicate reply is rejected and does not perform an actual export."
msgstr "在你展示给用户的提示词旁，保存会话、请求和工具调用的标识符。针对另一个请求的回复绝不能为当前请求授权。示例会检查重复的回复被拒绝，并且不会执行真正的导出。"

#: ../../examples/approval.rst:41
msgid "Complete source"
msgstr "完整源码"

